Privacy Policy for SG Assist

Effective Date: March 28, 2025

SG Assist Bot respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle user data when you use our Discord application. By using SG Assist Bot, you agree to the terms outlined in this Privacy Policy.
1. Data Collection

SG Assist Bot does not collect, store, or retain any user data. The bot operates by processing user-provided inputs (e.g., character names and report IDs) and passing them directly to the WoW Audit API. No data is stored on our servers or retained by the bot.
2. How Data is Used

    User inputs (character names and report IDs) are used solely to interact with the WoW Audit API and provide the requested functionality.

    Once the data is passed to WoW Audit, it is handled under WoW Audit's privacy policy and terms of service.

3. Data Sharing

SG Assist Bot does not share any user data with third parties. However, user-provided inputs are sent to the WoW Audit API as part of the bot's functionality. Users should review WoW Audit's privacy policy for further details on how their data is managed.
4. Data Security

Since SG Assist Bot does not store or retain any user data, there are no specific security measures implemented for storing or protecting data. However, we strive to ensure secure communication between the bot and the WoW Audit API.
5. Children's Privacy

SG Assist Bot is intended for users who meet Discord's minimum age requirement (13 years old in most regions). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13.
6. Third-Party Services

SG Assist Bot interacts with the WoW Audit API to provide its functionality. Any data shared with WoW Audit is subject to their terms of service and privacy policy. SG Assist Bot is not responsible for how WoW Audit handles your data.
7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time to reflect changes in the bot's functionality or applicable laws. Continued use of SG Assist Bot after changes are made constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.
8. Contact Information

If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or how SG Assist Bot handles your data, please contact us at shodo.sec@gmail.com.
